    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA naacwera omusango Yuda na Yerusaalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hati, MUKAMA, ow'obusobozi bwona naija kwihaho Yerusaalemu na Yuda buli kintu kyona, na buli muntu weena abantu ou babaire nibeesiga, naija kubaihaho ebyokulya byabo n'amaizi gaabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abantu baabo emanzi n'abaserikale baabo, abacwi baabo b'emisango n'abarangi baabo, abaraguzi baabo, abeebembezi baabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "engabwa ey'amakumi ataano, omuntu wabo ow'ekitiinisa, omuhanuzi n'omufumu, na buli muntu anyakwekoonyeza amasano okumanya ebiribaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndifora aboojo nubo babe bakuru baabo, mbateereho abaana abato nubo babaleme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu balibonesangana, omuntu alibonesa mugenzi we, omutaahi abonese omutaahi; abantu abato baligaya abakuru, abatali b'ekitiinisa baligaya ab'ekitiinisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu obwalikwata owanyina ow'omunju ya ise akamugamba ati: “Iwe, oina ekyokujwara osemeriire kuba mwebembezi waitu, ebikamburo binu byona, bibe byawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha kiro eki, oli kikomwa aligarukamu ati: “Tinyina ekinsobora kukugasira tinyina byokulya kandi tinyina byokujwara; nangwa, otanfoora mwebembezi wanyu!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yerusaalemu, hati bikambuuro, Yuda nayo egwire ira; ebigambo n'ebikorwa byabo nibijuma MUKAMA, nibijuma ekitiinisa kye; okusoroora kwabo omu bantu, nukwo kurukubasingisa omusango; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ebibi byabo nibakyoleka burole nka Sodomu, tibarukukisereka. Kiribahikaho! Ziribabona! Habwokuba, akabi bakakeereetera bonka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mugambire abahikiriire muti: “Mulihiirwa, habwokuba obu, nubwo baliheebwa eki baakoliire.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ababi ziribabona! Eki baakozire abantu abandi, nabo nikyo balikolerwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bange-abaana nubo barukubaliisa beegemere kandi abakazi nubo barukubalema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ai, abantu bange, abeebembezi banyu nubo baabahabisize, nukwo kulemwa kumanya nambere muraatoma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA ayemeriire kubaza ebigambo bye, amaliriire kucwera abantu be omusango, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kucwera omusango abakuru n'abalemi b'abantu be naagamba ati: “Ninywe mwanyagire engonjo z'emizabbibbu, kandi amaju ganyu, gaijwire ebintu ebi mwaihireho abanaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timurukwikirizibwa kusaaliza abantu bange n'okugobeza abanaku,” nyowe MUKAMA omulemi omukuru ow'obusobozi bwona, ninyowe ngambire eki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA akagamba ati: “Abaisiki ba Siyoni nibeehurra, nibarubata batungwire ebikya, nibaroza amaiso ag'orwanju, nibagenda nibakaga ha maguru bataireho enjogera; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baleke ndibafubira emitwe ngimalemu isoke.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha kiro eki, MUKAMA nubwo aliihaho abakazi aba Siyoni, buli kintu kyona eki bagonza muno: ebintu eby'okwekunisa ebi bajwara ha maguru, ha mutwe, omubikya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ha mikono, ebirezi, obutimba, amajugo, emikuufu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ebitambaara, ebiremba, amarangani, emyeko, obusanduko bw'ebiboya nengisa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "empeta ezi bajwara ha ngaro na ha nyindo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ebyokujwara byabo byona, n'emyenagiro, n'ensahu z'okuhagatira, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ebyokujwara byabo ebirukurorrana ebitambaara eby'engaro ebya kitaani, ebiremba n'ebitambaara ebiraihire ebya ha mutwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaayeteeraga ebirukuboya, lero balinuunka; abaajwaraga enkoba nyaburungi, balyeteega ebiguhaguha; abaabaga n'isoke erirungi balicweka oruhara; abajwaraga engoye enungi, baraajwaraga obucence; oburungi obwabeehulizaaga, bulibarugiramu ensoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.3.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
